{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the Demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features <strong>Freeplay Mode</strong>\u00a0where you get to experience the base typing gameplay of Type Her to Sleep at your leisure with multiple difficulties to choose from.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type to Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her sleep by typing out her thoughts each night. Every keystroke brings her one step closer to a good night\u2019s rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.poster.avif?t=1760319936\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.webm?t=1760319936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.mp4?t=1760319936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What To Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you make or words you miss, the more her stress builds until she can\u2019t sleep at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type, helping build your muscle memory. Includes at least 5,000 words with lengths up to 12 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for every skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092800?t=1760319936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092800?t=1760319936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/43236a20c848461ae02137ed73470aaf16b4c57a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760319936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/43236a20c848461ae02137ed73470aaf16b4c57a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760319936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the Demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features <strong>Freeplay Mode</strong>\u00a0where you get to experience the base typing gameplay of Type Her to Sleep at your leisure with multiple difficulties to choose from.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type to Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her sleep by typing out her thoughts each night. Every keystroke brings her one step closer to a good night\u2019s rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.poster.avif?t=1760319936\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.webm?t=1760319936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092800/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.mp4?t=1760319936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What To Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos yo